APOLLO_API_KEY=
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=

ALLOWED_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]

Just run a cp env.example .env in the backend folder and fill in the values. Do NOT commit `.env` to git abeg.SUPABASE_JWT_AUDIENCE=authenticated
